Emotion assignment took a sharp turn. Here, we transform from one emotion to another. For me, it was from disgust to peace. For, the disgusting creature to turn peaceful, I initially planned to change the color of the background to a sky blue, then the creature color and then the pimple to go away. But, that turned out to be too complicated. Then I thought about whatpeace for me would be, the first thing that came to mind was a good sunny morning. So, I decided to turn the head of the creature into the sun and the all the remaining body parts would go away from the canvas creating a good morning sun.
